{"title": "Eliette", "pageid": 52177, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Eliette", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Characters", "Elves", "High Elves", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Eliette</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Custom.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 1x, /w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Custom.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hometown\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hometown</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Depths\" title=\"Whispering Depths\">Whispering Depths</a><br>(underneath <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>)</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a>        </div>\n<p><b>Eliette</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a> arachnomancer mentioned in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. \n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/70px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/105px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/140px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/70px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">I will find solitude, and I will worship <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\">Lolth</a> with my very soul.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Eliette</a>, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Journal\" title=\"Bloody Journal\">Bloody Journal</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Eliette is the author of multiple works which can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Depths\" title=\"Whispering Depths\">Whispering Depths</a>. She used to live above ground but due to her fascination for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/23px-Lolth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/31px-Lolth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lolth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\">Lolth</a> moved underground. In her works she refers to herself as a high elf.\n</p><p>Her books tell the story of her regret at living on the surface for so long before moving to the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>, her capture by a group of <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">drow</a>, a vision of her escape when her captors' house falls, and being blessed with two gifts from Lolth: the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spiderstep_Boots\" title=\"Spiderstep Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Spiderstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spiderstep_Boots\" title=\"Spiderstep Boots\">Spiderstep Boots</a> from a fallen drow \"heretic\", and the body of an Arachnomancer from which she copies the sigils scarred on its face to her own, and grants her the ability to shapeshift into a spider.\n</p><p>Within the Whispering Depths she experimented with a method to transcend into a full spider form, after being unhappy with merely shapeshifting into one. It is strongly implied Eliette became the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/38px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/50px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Journal\" title=\"Bloody Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Journal\" title=\"Bloody Journal\">Bloody Journal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burnt_Journal\" title=\"Burnt Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\