picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Hermit_C_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Tattered_Journal\" title=\"Tattered Journal\">Tattered Journal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Web-Covered_Journal\" title=\"Web-Covered Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Web-Covered_Journal\" title=\"Web-Covered Journal\">Web-Covered Journal</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url: